# Local-only trees that must never enter a build context. Measured on a local
# `docker build` from a working tree: test_data/ contributed 71 MB containing
# 6,455 real library paths (the owner's film index, which AGENTS.md names as
# the personal data on this project), and .claude/ contributed 473 MB of agent
# worktrees, taking the image from 243 MB to 936 MB.
#
# CI checks out neither, so published images were never affected: this closes
# the local-build path only, for the same reason .e2e-* above is excluded.
test_data/
.claude/
# Untracked root-level dev scripts (gitignored, so invisible to git but not to
# Docker).
test_*.py
